        },
        {
          "text": " Yoshua akawauliza wana wa Israeli, akasema, Je! Hata lini mtakuwa walegevu katika kuingia kwenu na kuimiliki hiyo nchi, ambayo yeye BWANA, Mungu wa baba zenu, amewapa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haya, jichagulieni watu watatu kwa ajili ya kila kabila; nami nitawatuma, nao watainuka waende kati ya hiyo nchi, na kuiandika kama urithi wao ulivyo; kisha watanijia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
